{"page":206,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"3.4 • 신뢰성 있는 데이터 전송의 원리","words":[{"text":"3.4","x":922,"y":144,"width":42,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":997,"y":148,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"신뢰성","x":1045,"y":141,"width":80,"height":30},{"text":"있는","x":1138,"y":142,"width":55,"height":28},{"text":"데이터","x":1205,"y":144,"width":80,"height":28},{"text":"전송의","x":1299,"y":144,"width":80,"height":29},{"text":"원리","x":1393,"y":144,"width":53,"height":28}]},{"text":"미 패킷이 중복되있을 경우를 처리하기 위한 충분한 기능(순서번호)을 가지고 있다.","words":[{"text":"미","x":170,"y":262,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"패킷이","x":216,"y":261,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"중복되있을","x":329,"y":262,"width":163,"height":37},{"text":"경우를","x":506,"y":264,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"처리하기","x":613,"y":266,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"위한","x":753,"y":267,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"충분한","x":827,"y":269,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"기능(순서번호)을","x":941,"y":268,"width":271,"height":38},{"text":"가지고","x":1226,"y":270,"width":104,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1346,"y":268,"width":76,"height":36}]},{"text":"송신자의 관점에서 재전송은 만병통치약과 같다. 송신자는 데이터 피|것이 손실되","words":[{"text":"송신자의","x":235,"y":320,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"관점에서","x":385,"y":320,"width":124,"height":38},{"text":"재전송은","x":528,"y":322,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"만병통치약과","x":670,"y":325,"width":194,"height":36},{"text":"같다.","x":880,"y":326,"width":72,"height":36},{"text":"송신자는","x":969,"y":325,"width":140,"height":37},{"text":"데이터","x":1127,"y":327,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"피|것이","x":1248,"y":327,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"손실되","x":1368,"y":325,"width":103,"height":37}]},{"text":"있는지, ACK가 손실되었는지, 패것 또는 ACK가 단순히 지나치게 지연된 것인지를","words":[{"text":"있는지,","x":169,"y":379,"width":108,"height":37},{"text":"ACK가","x":297,"y":379,"width":112,"height":38},{"text":"손실되었는지,","x":424,"y":381,"width":201,"height":37},{"text":"패것","x":643,"y":383,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"또는","x":722,"y":384,"wid