"width":141,"height":36},{"text":"다음처럼","x":1338,"y":562,"width":135,"height":37}]},{"text":"동작해야 한다.","words":[{"text":"동작해야","x":165,"y":619,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"한다.","x":315,"y":619,"width":73,"height":37}]},{"text":"1. 매 패것(첫 번째 또는 재전송 패것)이 송신된 시간에 타이머를 시작한","words":[{"text":"1.","x":187,"y":716,"width":26,"height":27},{"text":"매","x":230,"y":711,"width":31,"height":36},{"text":"패것(첫","x":278,"y":711,"width":112,"height":38},{"text":"번째","x":406,"y":713,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"또는","x":482,"y":714,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"재전송","x":560,"y":711,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"패것)이","x":669,"y":711,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"송신된","x":790,"y":712,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"시간에","x":904,"y":713,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"타이머를","x":1019,"y":714,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"시작한","x":1173,"y":715,"width":105,"height":37}]},{"text":"2. 타이머 인터럽트에 반응함(적당한 행동을 취함)","words":[{"text":"2.","x":184,"y":774,"width":28,"height":28},{"text":"타이머","x":229,"y":770,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"인터럽트에","x":347,"y":771,"width":161,"height":38},{"text":"반응함(적당한","x":524,"y":771,"width":208,"height":39},{"text":"행동을","x":744,"y":772,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"취함)","x":856,"y":773,"width":78,"height":38}]},{"text":"3. 타이머를 멈춤","words":[{"text":"3.","x":184,"y":833,"width":28,"height":29},{"text":"타이머를","x":230,"y":830,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"멈춤","x":381,"y":831,"width":64,"height":36}]},{"text":"그림 3.15는 패것이 손상되거나 손실될 수 있는 채널에서 데이터를 신뢰적으로 전","words":[{"text":"그림","x":232,"y":933,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"3.15는","x":312,"y":935,"width":101,"height":34},{"text":"패것이","x":427,"y":934,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"손상되거나","x":537,"y":934,"width":164,"height":38},{"text":"손실될","x":713,"y":936,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":825,"y":937,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"있는","x":872,"y":936,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"채널에서","x":952,"y":938,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"데이터를","x":1104,"y":939,"width"